      "role": "user",
      "content": "Thanks. For the lit review, I need to be specific about the \"evidence\" they usually cite. What kind of data or studies do they typically point to when they try to make these claims about IQ or cognitive gaps? Like, are there specific researchers or specific types of psychometric tests they rely on?",
